We examined _Hubble Space Telescope_ (_HST_) archival [O iii] images of the remnant. Figure 6 is a composite color image of the remnant with the 6 cm radio data in red, the _HST_ [O iii] data in green, and the _Chandra_ X-ray data in light blue. The _Chandra_ absolute coordinates are currently uncertain at a level of at least \\sim1'' (see SS2).

